ْقَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَبْعًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شِدَادًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "37:97", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3885.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They said: Build for him a building and fling him in the red-hotfire.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar: \"Haydin onun için bir yapı yapın da onu ateşe atın.\" dediler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولے اس کے لیے ایک عمارت چنو پھر اسے بھڑکتی آگ میں ڈال دو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka berkata: \"Dirikanlah suatu bangunan untuk (membakar) Ibrahim; lalu lemparkanlah dia ke dalam api yang menyala-nyala itu\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱبْنُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/16530c736d6e4e818b59.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sagradite", "en": "build", "tr": "inşa edin", "fr": "construisez", "id": "bangunlah", "ur": "بناؤ", "bn": "নির্মাণ করো", "fa": "بسازید"}}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بُنْيَٰنًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَلْقُوهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْجَحِيمِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "40:36", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4169.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And Pharaoh said: O Haman! Build for me a tower that haply I may reach the roads,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Firavun dedi ki: \"Ey Hâmân! Bana bir kule yap, belki ben o yollara ulaşabilirim.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور فرعون بولا اے ہامان! میرے لیے اونچا محل بنا شاید میں پہنچ جاؤں راستوں تک،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan berkatalah Fir'aun: \"Hai Haman, buatkanlah bagiku sebuah bangunan yang tinggi supaya aku sampai ke pintu-pintu,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِرْعَوْنُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَٰهَٰمَٰنُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱبْنِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4685887dcfa9ee634cd9.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "build!", "bs": "gradi!", "tr": "inşa et!", "fr": "construis !", "id": "bangunlah!", "ur": "بنا!", "bn": "নির্মাণ কর!", "fa": "بنا کن!"}}, {"text": "لِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَرْحًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّعَلِّىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَبْلُغُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَسْبَٰبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "91:5", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6048.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And the heaven and Him Who built it,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Göğe ve onu bina edene,", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور آسمان اور اس کے بنانے والے کی قسم،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan langit serta pembinaannya,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "glos